# Fixture-backed happy path. The proxy fixture should return an available
# Montréal result whose title is "Dune".
clean
tap Title, author, or ISBN
type dune
tap Search
wait-for Results
expect Results
tap Dune
wait-for Book details
expect Book details
tap Montréal
wait-for Confirm borrow
expect Confirm borrow
expect The LCPL stays on the home server. Nothing is downloaded
tap Borrow & send
wait-for Queue
expect Queue
